order and our wait for food was average. Since we'd never eaten here before, we didn't know what to expect. Brandie brought out big platters heaped with fries and good sized po' boys that looked delicious. Everyone's meal was great! (Roast beef po' boy could use gravy. Not their fault, we forgot to order it with the sandwich). Sandwiches, burgers and tacos were all good and portions were substantial. Staff visited the table a few times to see how we were doing. Bathrooms were surprisingly clean for a restaurant in the quarter. Bill for 6 of ..."},{"business_id":"fzWfyNec66KVLoulLP2E5A","review_id":"JHPPVeuqoO4SAIUEPhPxKA","date":"2019-03-11T22:17:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9152323007583618,"text_excerpt":"We walked into Flambo after a morning of shopping around the French Quarter. It was around 1pm so the lunch rush was over. Our server was friendly and engaging (so was the cook who recommended a few items on the menu). The menu consists of burgers, hot dogs, po-boys, shrimp and grits, and seafood platters. We ordered a Flambo Burger, Fried Oyster Po-Boy and Shrimp Po-Boy. These po-boys are loaded! Nice batter and crispy. Seasoned fries were yummy, too."},{"business_id":"fzWfyNec66KVLoulLP2E5A","review_id":"qpIrYHpEE4lDE0CWQtjLMA","date":"2018-02-26T19:58:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9033207893371582,"text_excerpt":"Great little burger place to relax, nice service (Keenan g) and AMAZING crispy fries! Love the had the breakfast burger and the buffalo chicken P.O.'boy (the chicken was very thin compared to sandwich ratio but flavored well. They were out of half the menu items tho so they lost a star."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fzWfyNec66KVLoulLP2E5A","photo_id":"9a-NGLUC6V4hYaXpHbixsg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9a-NGLUC6V4hYaXpHbixsg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9359040856361389},{"business_id":"fzWfyNec66KVLoulLP2E5A","photo_id":"qGdYlCOw_q1QgTBhqeUIgQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qGdYlCOw_q1QgTBhqeUIgQ.jpg","vi